translate chinese ep7_64df9831:

    # e "*hics* Yes... Yes, I do!"
    e "*抽泣* 是的……很多！"

# game/ep7.rpy:344
translate chinese ep7_a652b001:

    # mc "Then hold on to that."
    mc "麻烦你先忍一下啦。"

# game/ep7.rpy:347
translate chinese ep7_3ddac974:

    # mc "Watch her for me."
    mc "替我照顾好她。"

# game/ep7.rpy:348
translate chinese ep7_77f22eca:

    # g "Uhm... Okay."
    g "呃……好。"

# game/ep7.rpy:352
translate chinese ep7_50e43e09:

    # e "*thud*"
    e "*砰*"

# game/ep7.rpy:353
translate chinese ep7_fd267a47:

    # g "Dude, hey! What's happening? It's so early in the morning and I'm so confused!"
    g "我的天啊！到底怎么了？这么一大早的，我根本搞不明白什么情况啊！"

# game/ep7.rpy:354
translate chinese ep7_8c068702:

    # g "Why is everyone so dead-ass, and why the hell are you crying?"
    g "怎么人人都火气这么大，你又怎么哭了啊？"

# game/ep7.rpy:357
translate chinese ep7_0f413fc8:

    # e "*sobs* Gweeeeen~!"
    e "*大哭* 格温~~~~！"

# game/ep7.rpy:358
translate chinese ep7_00590519:

    # g "Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold the phone!"
    g "停，停，停！给我等等！"

# game/ep7.rpy:359
translate chinese ep7_3d4d1739:

    # g "Who are you?! Where's Emma?!"
    g "你是谁？！你把艾玛藏哪去了？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:360
translate chinese ep7_429e6c3e:

    # e "It's me~!"
    e "是我啊~！"

# game/ep7.rpy:363
translate chinese ep7_8c391b08:

    # g "Then what's happening?! I'm getting creeped out, you know?"
    g "那到底什么情况啊？！我都被你吓坏了！"

# game/ep7.rpy:364
translate chinese ep7_ad6e165b_3:

    # e "......"
    e "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:372
translate chinese ep7_4eb111ea:

    # e "Am I horrible for making such decisions?"
    e "我做那种决定是说明我很差劲吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:373
translate chinese ep7_a2eb9b83:

    # e "Am I stupid for wanting something better?"
    e "我只想过得更好受点，是说明我很傻吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:376
translate chinese ep7_04dad837:

    # g "Why... didn't you tell me anything before?"
    g "为什么……你之前都不告诉我呢？"

# game/ep7.rpy:379
translate chinese ep7_bf253b9b:

    # g "No... you didn't tell anyone... right?"
    g "不对……你没告诉任何人……对吧？"

# game/ep7.rpy:380
translate chinese ep7_c210df27:

    # g "That's why those two lost it when they realized what's happening."
    g "所以那两个人在知道真相之后才那么生气。"

# game/ep7.rpy:383
translate chinese ep7_9fbe95bf:

    # e "I couldn't... Not until earlier..."
    e "我没法说出来……只是刚才实在瞒不住了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:384
translate chinese ep7_81ab8936:

    # e "I was so afraid of what might happen if I did..."
    e "我太害怕我说了之后会出什么意外了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:387
translate chinese ep7_3fd10372:

    # e "I'm so afraid of losing anybody I care about because of me..."
    e "我太害怕会有我爱的人因我而死……"

# game/ep7.rpy:390
translate chinese ep7_a2a3fde2:

    # e "I'm so afraid that my decision will lead us into the worst possible scenario..."
    e "我太害怕我的决定会让我们走向最坏的结局……"

# game/ep7.rpy:393
translate chinese ep7_1acfa828:

    # e "Just call me a cowa-"
    e "因为我是个胆小——"

# game/ep7.rpy:397
translate chinese ep7_6d7b3b0c:

    # g "*slaps*"
    g "*耳光*"

# game/ep7.rpy:398
translate chinese ep7_004332a0_1:

    # e "Ahh..."
    e "啊……"

# game/ep7.rpy:401
translate chinese ep7_fdd8c635:

    # g "*hugs*"
    g "*拥抱*"

# game/ep7.rpy:402
translate chinese ep7_411ccdfb:

    # g "Shut up..."
    g "别说了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:403
translate chinese ep7_ef24df2a:

    # g "Just fucking shut up..."
    g "不要再说了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:404
translate chinese ep7_51229b3f:

    # g "You've lost everything multiple times, and yet... here you are..."
    g "你已经失去一切不止一次了，但是……你还是坚持到了现在……"

# game/ep7.rpy:405
translate chinese ep7_f3a81299:

    # g "Never... ever... call yourself a coward."
    g "永远……永远……别说你是胆小鬼。"

# game/ep7.rpy:406
translate chinese ep7_25a66be6:

    # g "Because If I were in your place, I don't know if I would still have the will to live..."
    g "如果遭受这一切的是我的话，我都不知道我还有没有继续活下去的想法……"

# game/ep7.rpy:407
translate chinese ep7_09d4d4e7:

    # g "You are the most strong-willed woman... I have ever known, Emma."
    g "你是我见过的……最坚强的女孩了，艾玛。"

# game/ep7.rpy:408
translate chinese ep7_541ebc37:

    # g "To be honest with you, I really hate drama like this, that's why I ran away from my mother's beliefs in the first place..."
    g "说实话，我真的很讨厌这种爱恨情仇之类的东西，所以我才从一开始就在逃避我妈妈的信仰……"

# game/ep7.rpy:409
translate chinese ep7_e239a2df:

    # g "Not a single tear came from my eyes for a long, long time after that..."
    g "自那之后，我已经很久很久没有流过哪怕一滴眼泪了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:412
translate chinese ep7_782e49b6:

    # g "However, you... for fuck's sake... are making me tear up like shit..."
    g "但是，你……天啊……让我怎么也忍不住想哭……"

# game/ep7.rpy:413
translate chinese ep7_ee6ca09a:

    # g "You know, Em... There are things that we cannot control no matter how hard we try."
    g "你知道吗，小艾……世界上有些事是我们无论如何也控制不了的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:414
translate chinese ep7_ffa89c0c:

    # g "But those two are stupid. And sometimes, being stupid is what it takes to have courage to do a lot of things others cannot."
    g "但那两个人是傻子。有时候，只有够傻，才会有足够的勇气去做别人做不到的事。"

# game/ep7.rpy:415
translate chinese ep7_8b2ffa64:

    # g "All we can do... is have faith and trust that everything will be alright."
    g "我们能做的……只有坚定信念，相信一切都会好起来的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:416
translate chinese ep7_096c7f92:

    # g "Just believe in them."
    g "相信他们就好了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:417
translate chinese ep7_1e59eb1a:

    # g "...For now, cry your heart out. I'll be here for you."
    g "……现在，你想哭就尽情哭出来吧。我会在这陪着你的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:420
translate chinese ep7_a9c67781:

    # e "*hics*"
    e "*抽泣*"

# game/ep7.rpy:430
translate chinese ep7_d1ddaffa:

    # "........"
    "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:431
translate chinese ep7_9ea6b0e1:

    # ".............."
    "…………"

# game/ep7.rpy:432
translate chinese ep7_9643c6c4:

    # a "Who are you calling? You know I can just-"
    a "你在给谁打电话？你也知道我可以直接——"

# game/ep7.rpy:435
translate chinese ep7_ac62cc36:

    # mc "Shhhhh..."
    mc "嘘……"

# game/ep7.rpy:436
translate chinese ep7_542e77a0:

    # mc "It's who I hope will be my secret weapon... who also happens to be your aunt."
    mc "是我的秘密武器……恰好也是你的小姨。"

# game/ep7.rpy:439
translate chinese ep7_8929cfa8:

    # a "Pardon?"
    a "什么？"

# game/ep7.rpy:440
translate chinese ep7_3e9ff12b:

    # mc "I learned about this through Emma, I'll explain later."
    mc "我是通过艾玛才知道的，之后再跟你解释。"

# game/ep7.rpy:441
translate chinese ep7_3456bf52:

    # a "But why are you calling my... {b}aunt{/b}? If that's really true. I don't have one as far as I know."
    a "但你为什么要找我的……{b}小姨{/b}？而且你说的是真的吗？据我所知我没有小姨啊。"

# game/ep7.rpy:444
translate chinese ep7_3b21f354_4:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:445
translate chinese ep7_cdbfb638:

    # a "Why do you always look like that when you find me stupid? I'm just telling you!"
    a "你怎么每次觉得我很傻的时候都这个表情？我只是实话实说！"

# game/ep7.rpy:454
translate chinese ep7_b3f3d3bb:

    # mc "You and your family are waaay too much for me, Aine."
    mc "你还有你家里的事对我来说实在太乱套了，艾妮。"

# game/ep7.rpy:455
translate chinese ep7_8e92b34b:

    # a "...Aren't you nervous?"
    a "……你不紧张吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:456
translate chinese ep7_29ac7776:

    # mc "Uhh... Why should I be? Is there anything I should be nervous about?"
    mc "呃……为什么要紧张？有什么值得我紧张的事吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:457
translate chinese ep7_72d76cb9:

    # a "Excuse you..."
    a "提醒你一下……"

# game/ep7.rpy:458
translate chinese ep7_eb62a623:

    # a "You're meeting my mother — Hera."
    a "你马上要见我妈妈——赫拉了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:459
translate chinese ep7_7461eef1:

    # a "Owner of several companies in this city."
    a "城里好几家大公司的老板。"

# game/ep7.rpy:460
translate chinese ep7_0a8e3655:

    # a "The current leader of Agnor Family Mafia."
    a "阿格诺家族黑手党的现任老大。"

# game/ep7.rpy:461
translate chinese ep7_40db1085:

    # mc "Wait, what?!"
    mc "等等，什么？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:462
translate chinese ep7_388c32af:

    # mc "Mafia?!"
    mc "黑手党？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:463
translate chinese ep7_045e969a:

    # a "Uh-huh?"
    a "对啊？"

# game/ep7.rpy:464
translate chinese ep7_73858cc8:

    # mc "Why didn't you tell me that beforehand?!"
    mc "你怎么不早说啊？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:465
translate chinese ep7_73448be5:

    # a "Well, because you never asked!"
    a "你也没问啊！"

# game/ep7.rpy:466
translate chinese ep7_b99db0fc:

    # a "Why do you think the other students were afraid of me back then?"
    a "不然你觉得为什么以前其他学生都那么怕我？"

# game/ep7.rpy:467
translate chinese ep7_d142974b:

    # a "Why do you think the school officials could never touch me?"
    a "为什么学校里的领导从来都不敢管我？"

# game/ep7.rpy:468
translate chinese ep7_80c455db:

    # j "Excuse me, lovebirds. You shouldn't be fighting this early in the morning."
    j "打扰了，小两口。这么大清早的就别吵架了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:471
translate chinese ep7_078b0f5d:

    # mc "Oh, hey, uhh... Sorry, we were just arguing about something."
    mc "哦，嗨，呃……抱歉，我们只是在争一点事情。"

# game/ep7.rpy:472
translate chinese ep7_ccc07b87:

    # j "Yes, that's what I just said, [mc!t]."
    j "是啊，我就是这个意思，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep7.rpy:473
translate chinese ep7_3825b1a9:

    # mc "Did you hear everything?"
    mc "你都听见了？"

# game/ep7.rpy:474
translate chinese ep7_480760d7:

    # j "Just from the moment she mentioned Agnor Family."
    j "正好从她提到阿格诺家族开始听的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:475
translate chinese ep7_c2efa5fa:

    # j "{b}My{/b} family."
    j "那是{b}我的{/b}家族。"

# game/ep7.rpy:476
translate chinese ep7_82d0ec0d:

    # j "But I suppose I shouldn't say that."
    j "不过我可能也不该提这事。"

# game/ep7.rpy:477
translate chinese ep7_49c05a17:

    # mc "So you are a member of this Mafia thing, huh?"
    mc "所以你也是黑手党的一份子？"

# game/ep7.rpy:478
translate chinese ep7_db2522a0:

    # j "I may carry the last name, but I am in fact not a part of it."
    j "我确实是这个家族的人，但是跟黑手党没一点关系。"

# game/ep7.rpy:479
translate chinese ep7_079efae1:

    # j "*chuckles* I'm way too far ahead of them."
    j "*笑* 我可跟他们差得太多了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:481
translate chinese ep7_3c801f1c:

    # mc "That chuckle tells me everything."
    mc "你笑的这一声就已经足够说明了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:485
translate chinese ep7_c778cd9e:

    # j "And your lack of reaction tells me that you don't seem to believe anything."
    j "而你什么反应都没有，说明你根本不信吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:486
translate chinese ep7_b6d5acf1:

    # mc "Well, yeah. I have too many doubts about this, thus I have a question for you, Miss Jess."
    mc "是啊。我有太多疑惑了，所以我有问题要问你，婕斯小姐。"

# game/ep7.rpy:487
translate chinese ep7_1cef3976:

    # mc "No... Jess."
    mc "不……婕斯。"

# game/ep7.rpy:488
translate chinese ep7_bfeb5a8e:

    # j "...Now that's the way my employees should address me."
    j "……我的员工就该这么称呼我。"

# game/ep7.rpy:489
translate chinese ep7_a81bdf23:

    # j "You seem... not like yourself today. What's up?"
    j "你今天……不太像平日的你啊。怎么了？"

# game/ep7.rpy:490
translate chinese ep7_3b21f354_5:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:491
translate chinese ep7_286808e5:

    # mc "...Are you guys using me?"
    mc "……你们是在利用我吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:494
translate chinese ep7_76016e37:

    # j "*chuckles* And where did you get that idea?"
    j "*笑* 你这又是听谁说的？"

# game/ep7.rpy:495
translate chinese ep7_987dff6c:

    # mc "I don't have any informant, but I'm not that stupid, Jess."
    mc "没人跟我说，但我也不傻，婕斯。"

# game/ep7.rpy:496
translate chinese ep7_f284ffd6:

    # mc "These girls coming here was way too much of a coincidence for Emma to pick."
    mc "艾玛他们来我家实在是过于巧合了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:497
translate chinese ep7_88f6b816:

    # mc "Agreeing for me to meet your sister was way too easy."
    mc "你同意我去见你姐姐也同意得太轻巧了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:498
translate chinese ep7_077f9520:

    # mc "You meeting me before wasn't a simple stroke of luck either, no?"
    mc "我们俩的相遇恐怕也不是因为我运气好吧？"

# game/ep7.rpy:499
translate chinese ep7_61a12bcd:

    # mc "And now, why do I feel that you have been waiting for this chance? I can hear eagerness in your voice."
    mc "还有现在，我怎么感觉你一直在等这个机会呢？我听得出来，你的声音很兴奋。"

# game/ep7.rpy:500
translate chinese ep7_2e560189:

    # j "Well, well..."
    j "哈哈，可以啊……"

# game/ep7.rpy:501
translate chinese ep7_65b552ea:

    # j "You... my boy... are indeed Georgia's nephew."
    j "你小子……确实是乔治亚的外甥。"

# game/ep7.rpy:502
translate chinese ep7_b40cf51b:

    # mc "Georgia? You mean, Aunt Georgia? [landlady!t]'s sister?"
    mc "乔治亚？你是说乔治亚姨妈吗？[landlady!t]的姐姐？"

# game/ep7.rpy:503
translate chinese ep7_a603da6e:

    # j "Precisely."
    j "正是。"

# game/ep7.rpy:504
translate chinese ep7_32078d22:

    # mc "What does she have to do with this?"
    mc "跟她有什么关系？"

# game/ep7.rpy:505
translate chinese ep7_371a1c0f:

    # j "Well, it looks like it's time for you to know."
    j "好吧，看来也是时候让你知道了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:506
translate chinese ep7_5b0e5857:

    # j "About you... and your real identity."
    j "有关你……真实身份的事。"

# game/ep7.rpy:507
translate chinese ep7_85bf6506:

    # j "But before that..."
    j "但在那之前……"

# game/ep7.rpy:508
translate chinese ep7_cf64db02:

    # j "Go ahead and finish what you guys started."
    j "先去把你们的事情做个了断吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:509
translate chinese ep7_db67afcd:

    # mc "So I was right, you were waiting for this to happen."
    mc "那我是对的，你确实在等这一切发生。"

# game/ep7.rpy:512
translate chinese ep7_4e0242a6:

    # j "Not quite. I was simply going with the flow, and of course, a huge part of it was a gamble."
    j "不尽然。我也只是随波逐流，而且有很大一部分也都是在赌。"

# game/ep7.rpy:513
translate chinese ep7_4a63b147:

    # j "I know this is confusing. That's why I am inviting you to come to our hideout after you are done with your business."
    j "我知道你搞不明白。所以我邀请你在处理完你的事之后，来我们的藏身处坐坐。"

# game/ep7.rpy:514
translate chinese ep7_fd37864b:

    # j "I bet you and your [landlady!t], might want to have a good talk as well."
    j "我想你和你[landlady!t]有不少话想说吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:515
translate chinese ep7_c4d32d11:

    # mc "I know, I have a lot of questions for her."
    mc "是啊，我有很多问题要问她。"

# game/ep7.rpy:516
translate chinese ep7_3b21f354_6:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:517
translate chinese ep7_9307a5a1:

    # mc "And since you seem to be using me, I'm going to ask you to return the favor, Jess."
    mc "既然你似乎在利用我，那我也要让你给我适当的回报，婕斯。"

# game/ep7.rpy:520
translate chinese ep7_0438a1d0:

    # j "*chuckles* I told you, I am not."
    j "*笑* 我说了，我没有利用你。"

# game/ep7.rpy:521
translate chinese ep7_e5205126:

    # j "Although, you sound exactly like your Aunt. You're not dropping your guard that easily, I like it."
    j "不过，你说起话来跟你小姨一模一样。你不会轻易放下防备，我喜欢。"

# game/ep7.rpy:522
translate chinese ep7_a3e7c869:

    # j "...Very well."
    j "……好吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:523
translate chinese ep7_7b2fe254:

    # j "How can I serve you, boss?"
    j "您有什么吩咐，老大？"

# game/ep7.rpy:524
translate chinese ep7_767385ce:

    # mc "I know this won't go that easy {b}if{/b} this so-called Mafia really exists. So I need men to protect us while we are in there."
    mc "{b}假如{/b}这个所谓的黑手党真的存在的话，那事情肯定不会很简单。我需要有人在我们跟赫拉对质的时候保护我们。"

# game/ep7.rpy:527
translate chinese ep7_dcf02389:

    # j "Alright, I'm sending two of my people to go with you."
    j "好，我派两个人跟你们一起去。"

# game/ep7.rpy:528
translate chinese ep7_34896b84:

    # mc "Just two?"
    mc "才两个？"

# game/ep7.rpy:531
translate chinese ep7_bb0985bf:

    # j "Believe me when I say that the two of them are more than enough."
    j "相信我吧，两个已经够用了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:532
translate chinese ep7_af7b2d20:

    # j "You're still in your house, right?"
    j "你们还在你家里对吧？"

# game/ep7.rpy:533
translate chinese ep7_7840abe1:

    # mc "We're not that far away."
    mc "我们没走多远。"

# game/ep7.rpy:534
translate chinese ep7_dfe501ee:

    # j "Good, wait for them."
    j "很好，等着她们吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:535
translate chinese ep7_6651ab87:

    # mc "Alright."
    mc "好的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:536
translate chinese ep7_a39c5aba:

    # j "And [mc!t]?"
    j "还有，[mc!t]？"

# game/ep7.rpy:537
translate chinese ep7_7c927b78:

    # mc "Yes?"
    mc "怎么了？"

# game/ep7.rpy:540
translate chinese ep7_f2c76433:

    # j "I'll just clarify that I am {b}not{/b} your enemy. I never was, and I never will be."
    j "我要跟你说清楚，我{b}不是{/b}你的敌人。从来不是，也永远不会是。"

# game/ep7.rpy:541
translate chinese ep7_5a5dbb9e:

    # j "And you... are not under anybody's control."
    j "还有你……没有被任何人控制。"

# game/ep7.rpy:542
translate chinese ep7_b0239f56:

    # j "Whether or not you take my word for it, is totally up to you."
    j "要不要信我的话，就完全取决于你自己了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:543
translate chinese ep7_0be4c811:

    # j "As for the rest, we'll talk later together with some people you might want to meet."
    j "剩下的，就等你来了之后，跟几个你可能想见的人一起谈吧。"

