translate chinese ep7_3ad5b472:

    # j "And the same goes for him as well."
    j "他肯定也是一样吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:554
translate chinese ep7_5e5424b2:

    # j "Remember, I am just your tool, your weapon, whatever you want to call me. I can never help you if it is between you two."
    j "记住，我只是你的工具，你的武器，或者你想怎么叫我都行。你们俩之间的事我是永远帮不上忙的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:557
translate chinese ep7_beeafba0:

    # k "I know my responsibility as his [landlady!t]."
    k "我知道我身为他的[landlady!t]，要负起怎么样的责任。"

# game/ep7.rpy:558
translate chinese ep7_6ce75aea:

    # j "Good."
    j "很好。"

# game/ep7.rpy:561
translate chinese ep7_d6f8e16c:

    # k "Aside from that, I'm really worried about their confrontation."
    k "除此之外，我也很担心这场对质会如何发展。"

