translate chinese ep7_cc657150:

    # j "Considering your history with my sister, your presence might make her rage more."
    j "考虑到你跟我姐姐之间的恩怨，你在场只会让她更生气。"

# game/ep7.rpy:564
translate chinese ep7_d528be42:

    # j "I will go there in your stead. I will bring the kids back safe and sound: you have my word."
    j "我替你去吧。我会把孩子们平安带回来的，我保证。"

# game/ep7.rpy:565
translate chinese ep7_b74f3f46:

    # j "Furthermore, I'm also worried about what will happen to Freya after this. I don't want her to get caught in the conflict."
    j "而且，我也很担心芙蕾雅的情况。我不想让她也被卷进去。"

# game/ep7.rpy:569
translate chinese ep7_721fff29:

    # k "......"
    k "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:570
translate chinese ep7_c3d8f09e:

    # j "Hey, chin up."
    j "哎，抬起头来。"

# game/ep7.rpy:571
translate chinese ep7_04ba10bd:

    # j "Once this is over, why don't you go back home for a while? Spend some time with your family and get rid of all of all your stubbornness."
    j "这之后，你干脆回家住一段怎么样？多陪陪家里人，别老是这么固执了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:574
translate chinese ep7_baaad39b:

    # k "...I still don't fully understand why are you so eager to help us with our situation, Jess."
    k "……我还是没法完全理解为什么你这么急着帮我们，婕斯。"

# game/ep7.rpy:575
