    # mc "Did we just step into a trap or something?"
    mc "难道这是陷阱？"

# game/ep7.rpy:754
translate chinese ep7_047ca56b:

    # a "No, that's not it."
    a "不，不是的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:755
translate chinese ep7_d0312e87:

    # a "Mother is a very straightforward person: if she wants to do it, she will do it in the most textbook way possible."
    a "我妈是个很直来直去的人：她想做什么事的话，会用最经典、最传统的方法去做。"

# game/ep7.rpy:756
translate chinese ep7_219359f1:

    # a "She's not the type to set traps."
    a "她不是那种会下圈套的人。"

# game/ep7.rpy:757
translate chinese ep7_549c479e:

    # a "There is no way the guards would abandon their posts just like that, either."
    a "守卫也不可能就那样玩忽职守的。"

