    # mc "Yes, it nice to finally meet you, Hera."
    mc "是啊，终于能见到你了，赫拉。"

# game/ep7.rpy:822
translate chinese ep7_ad4536a0:

    # mc "So, how does it feel to have your own daughter used against you?"
    mc "跟自己的亲生女儿为敌的滋味儿如何啊？"

