    h "啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊啊！！！！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1194
translate chinese ep7_3dc5c974:

    # h "I swore to myself that I would kill him because of what he did, but he was nowhere to be found no matter how much I tried to look for him."
    h "之后我发誓一定要杀了他，让他付出代价，但我不管花多大力气去找，也没有找到他。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1195
translate chinese ep7_f03fe5b2:

    # h "So you... took the brunt of his sins."
    h "所以你……要替他受罪。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1196
translate chinese ep7_92128c07:

    # h "He took my son from me, but instead of killing you in return, making you suffer was the best choice."
    h "他杀了我儿子，但与其为了报复把你也杀了，让你吃苦受罪才是最好的选择。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1199
translate chinese ep7_23932f81:

    # h "But even after that, he still won't show his face! He's nothing but a coward!"
    h "但哪怕你那么被折磨，他也没有露过面！他只是个懦夫而已！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1207
translate chinese ep7_4a6fcdda:

    # a "So, it was your [landlord!t]..."
    a "所以，是你的[landlord!t]……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1210
translate chinese ep7_1d141093_1:

    # mc "*clench*"
    mc "*握紧拳头*"

# game/ep7.rpy:1211
translate chinese ep7_d04901cd:

    # mc "*breathes heavily*"
    mc "*沉重地呼吸*"

# game/ep7.rpy:1212
translate chinese ep7_8063c8b6:

    # yt "This... can't be true..."
    yt "这……不可能……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1213
translate chinese ep7_cf45dfd9:

    # yt "There's no way he could do that..."
    yt "他不可能会做那样的事……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1214
translate chinese ep7_91b6bc2a:

    # yt "Compose yourself, [mc!t]... Compose yourself, don't let your feelings take over your actions..."
    yt "控制住自己，[mc!t]……冷静，不要被情绪冲昏了头脑……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1215
translate chinese ep7_189c5697:

    # yt "Not this time!"
    yt "这次绝对不行！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1218
translate chinese ep7_782e7ad0:

    # a "But why didn't you tell us anything about that?! We are your daughters — your family! Why did you keep it a secret from us?!"
    a "但为什么你从来没跟我们说过？！我们是你的女儿——你的家人！为什么你连我们都要瞒着？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1219
translate chinese ep7_08835719:

    # h "From the moment you were born... I knew you would follow your father's footsteps. Kindness was always the answer."
    h "从你出生那天开始……我就知道你和你爸爸一模一样。永远都是个善良的人。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1220
translate chinese ep7_e0cc6111:

    # h "Now that you know, if I asked you to do the same thing to him right now — would you?"
    h "既然现在你知道真相了，那我让你现在就把他杀了——你愿意吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1223
translate chinese ep7_732a8756_1:

    # a "......"
    a "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1224
translate chinese ep7_77a214b8:

    # a "..........."
    a "…………"

# game/ep7.rpy:1227
translate chinese ep7_9a58adc6:

    # a "No."
    a "不。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1228
translate chinese ep7_b44eb90c:

    # h "Exactly."
    h "我就知道。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1231
translate chinese ep7_584fd7ec:

    # mc "Somehow, it all... makes sense..."
    mc "好像，一切……都说得通了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1232
translate chinese ep7_f1ce6fc9:

    # mc "We waited for you for a decade because you said you would just follow us there..."
    mc "我们等你等了十年，因为你说你之后会来找我们……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1233
translate chinese ep7_ec23487b:

    # mc "So this was what you were doing, huh?"
    mc "原来你是跑去做这种事了，啊？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1234
translate chinese ep7_08f373b5:

    # mc "I lost someone important to me because of you..."
    mc "都是因为你，我失去了重要的人……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1235
translate chinese ep7_86e3959b:

    # mc "My life became hell because of you..."
    mc "都是因为你，我的生活变得一团糟……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1238
translate chinese ep7_58222245:

    # mc "Wherever you are..."
    mc "不管你现在在哪……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1239
translate chinese ep7_7240d50b:

    # mc "I'm going to find you, and you're not running away this time..."
    mc "我都要找到你，这次你绝不可能跑掉……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1240
translate chinese ep7_fb45f48f:

    # mc "If this is all true, then you are going to eat my fists... {b}[landlord!t]{/b}."
    mc "如果这一切都是真的，那你就等着尝尝我的拳头吧……{b}[landlord!t]{/b}。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1243
translate chinese ep7_8f4ab234:

    # mc "As for you..."
    mc "至于你……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1249
translate chinese ep7_a5f82a3a:

    # mc "...If you believe that I deserve to be punished because of what my [landlord!t] did to you, then so be it."
    mc "……如果你觉得我理应因为我[landlord!t]做的事受到惩罚，那就随你便吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1250
translate chinese ep7_b0397532:

    # mc "But my [landlord!t]'s sins are not my own. What you were doing to us was simply just an act of selfishness and obsession."
    mc "但我[landlord!t]的罪孽跟我没有关系。你做的一切都是因为你的自私和偏执。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1251
translate chinese ep7_1ff3e893:

    # mc "We were {b}innocent{/b} kids, Hera. But you decided to make us part of your story that we had nothing to do with."
    mc "我们是{b}无辜的{/b}，赫拉。但你偏要把我们卷进本来和我们没有任何关系的破事里。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1252
translate chinese ep7_5a687bfa:

    # mc "I want to kill you for toying with our lives..."
    mc "你这么玩弄我们的人生，我本来想杀了你的……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1253
translate chinese ep7_17614d4a:

    # mc "But, no..."
    mc "但是，不行……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1254
translate chinese ep7_0598ca78:

    # mc "I don't have the right to take your life."
    mc "我没有资格夺走你的生命。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1255
translate chinese ep7_11d1d5fd:

    # mc "However... I will make you suffer more than what you did to us."
    mc "然而……我会让你吃比我们吃过的更多的苦。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1256
translate chinese ep7_3fa06d3e:

    # mc "I'm stupid, and I may be nothing, but this nobody will bring you down. I will take everything that you have and I don't care who you are."
    mc "我是很傻，我也确实什么都不是，但我这个无名小卒迟早有一天会扳倒你的。我不在乎你有多厉害，我要摧毁你有的一切。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1259
translate chinese ep7_5a3c7e39:

    # h "{i}...*chuckles* You raised your [tenant!t] well, Klara."
    h "{i}…… *笑* 你把你[tenant!t]教得真好啊，克拉拉。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1264
translate chinese ep7_a5f82a3a_1:

    # mc "...If you believe that I deserve to be punished because of what my [landlord!t] did to you, then so be it."
    mc "……如果你觉得我理应因为我[landlord!t]做的事受到惩罚，那就随你便吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1265
translate chinese ep7_2d36b701:

    # mc "I understand that my [landlord!t] is the one in the wrong here. But that is no reason for you to control our lives."
    mc "我理解，我[landlord!t]做了错事。但那不是你玩弄我们的人生的理由。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1266
translate chinese ep7_8c7bdaee:

    # mc "You did not lose everything. Come on, you still have your {b}daughters{/b}. Why would you think that it's all over?"
    mc "你没有失去一切。你不明白吗？你还有{b}女儿{/b}啊！为什么你觉得万事皆休了呢？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1269
translate chinese ep7_0a2d5e34:

    # yt "However, what's mind-boggling in all of this is that he was able to kill someone, and a newborn child at that."
    yt "不过，最令我惊讶的是，他居然能下手杀人，甚至连刚出生的婴儿都不放过。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1270
translate chinese ep7_6053b351:

    # yt "Our time together was short, but all those years were enough for me to get to know the real him."
    yt "我们在一起度过的时间不长，但那几年时间也足够我了解真正的他了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1271
translate chinese ep7_39d56d69:

    # yt "And knowing him, there is no way in hell that he would do something like that..."
    yt "以我对他的了解，他无论如何也不可能做出那种事……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1272
translate chinese ep7_0bd2e506:

    # yt "Hearing Hera's story, he might have turned out to be a coward. But he doesn't seem to have any grudge with them."
    yt "听完赫拉讲的故事，或许他可能真的是个懦夫吧。但他理应跟赫拉一家无冤无仇。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1273
translate chinese ep7_4bc582e8:

    # yt "The last part was a sudden turn of events."
    yt "最后那部分实在是太突兀了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1274
translate chinese ep7_e55b9a70_2:

    # yt "......"
    yt "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1275
translate chinese ep7_170f1358:

    # yt "Is there..."
    yt "会不会……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1276
translate chinese ep7_e55b9a70_3:

    # yt "......"
    yt "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1277
translate chinese ep7_36366d0e:

    # yt "No, that's ridiculous considering what this old hag can do..."
    yt "不，考虑到这个老太婆的能耐，那就太扯了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1278
translate chinese ep7_51003620:

    # yt "Asking her would probably lead to denial either way."
    yt "就算问她，她应该也不会承认。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1279
translate chinese ep7_4aba3138:

    # yt "Let's play this safe for now."
    yt "现在还是保险一点比较好。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1282
translate chinese ep7_6744d0e5:

    # mc "Hey, old hag."
    mc "喂，老太婆。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1283
translate chinese ep7_2ba538fc:

    # h "Don't call me that, or I'll break your neck."
    h "再敢那么喊我，我就扭断你的脖子。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1284
translate chinese ep7_3228fe54:

    # m "Yeah, do that and it will be yours next. Don't forget that we're here, old woman."
    m "试试啊，看看谁的脖子会断。别忘了我们还在这呢，老女人。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1285
translate chinese ep7_317bb606:

    # mc "Why did you put a stop to all the bullying?"
    mc "为什么你最后让霸凌停下来了？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1286
translate chinese ep7_af3181c4_2:

    # h "......"
    h "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1287
translate chinese ep7_4b854fa8:

    # mc "Yeah, I know that you purposely stopped it. I have been wondering about that all this time."
    mc "我知道是你授意停下来的。我一直都想不通。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1288
translate chinese ep7_e5ceb5ac:

    # mc "[landlady!t] might have tried and asked, but she doesn't have any power to do it on her own considering what kind of person she was up against."
    mc "[landlady!t]确实努力阻止过，但背后的人是你，她估计也没有办法吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1289
translate chinese ep7_dfcf9036:

    # mc "You could've made Aine follow me to the same college, but you didn't."
    mc "你可以让艾妮继续跟我上同一所大学，但你没有。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1290
translate chinese ep7_fc8a28f2:

    # mc "You could've even killed me if you wanted to end it, but there was nothing after high school."
    mc "你想结束一切的话，甚至还可以杀了我，但是高中毕业之后，就什么也没发生过了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1291
translate chinese ep7_50dd2e83:

    # h "I don't have anything to say about that, just thank your [landlady!t]. She did that all by herself."
    h "这一点我没什么要说的，去感谢你[landlady!t]就是了。都是她一个人的功劳。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1292
translate chinese ep7_a60c7926:

    # mc "...Are you telling me the truth?"
    mc "……你说的是真的吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1293
translate chinese ep7_42d7fa27:

    # h "*chuckles* You have Georgia's blood, figure it out yourself, boy."
    h "*笑* 你可是乔治亚的血亲，自己慢慢想吧，小子。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1296
translate chinese ep7_cccc63fe:

    # yt "Yeah, I'm not buying it."
    yt "我才不信。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1297
translate chinese ep7_6b14af57:

    # yt "Fine, let's end it with this..."
    yt "行吧，还有最后一件事……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1300
translate chinese ep7_3b521b0d:

    # mc "Look, I don't care about what you did to me anymore, but what you've done to Emy and Aine is unconscionable."
    mc "听着，我已经不在乎你怎么折磨过我了，但你对艾米和艾妮做的事就太过分了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1301
translate chinese ep7_adf2466d:

    # mc "Someone will have to make you pay for everything, and I will be the judge of that."
    mc "迟早会有人让你为一切付出代价，到时候我会在一旁见证的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1304
translate chinese ep7_5a3c7e39_1:

    # h "{i}...*chuckles* You raised your [tenant!t] well, Klara."
    h "{i}... *笑* 你把你[tenant!t]教得真好啊，克拉拉。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1309
translate chinese ep7_f2338e67:

    # mc "We're done talking here."
    mc "我说完了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1310
translate chinese ep7_9644e0ae:

    # mc "Now, where are Emy's papers?"
    mc "现在，快把艾米的文件交出来。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1314
translate chinese ep7_f30eca04:

    # h "Hnn..."
    h "呵……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1317
translate chinese ep7_bfb4c789:

    # h "Ahh..."
    h "啊……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1318
translate chinese ep7_464dfc75:

    # h "You know, boy?"
    h "知道吗，小子？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1319
translate chinese ep7_864e97f2:

    # h "It's been a while..."
    h "我想这样已经很久了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1330
translate chinese ep7_7fe78607:

    # a "You! You dare to hit my-"
    a "你！你敢打我的——"

# game/ep7.rpy:1331
