translate chinese ep7_c2ca1848:

    # j "You don't have to go to work today, Lily. [mc!t] and Freya won't be able to come today either."
    j "你今天不用来上班了，莉莉。[mc!t]和芙蕾雅今天也都没法来了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1578
translate chinese ep7_fee1d60a:

    # l "Oh, did something happen?"
    l "出什么事了吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1579
translate chinese ep7_be67d2f7:

    # j "Nothing important, just take time off for now, alright?"
    j "没什么大事，你就先休息一天吧，好吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1580
translate chinese ep7_3d29c3d4:

    # l "...Alright, if you say so, Miss Jess."
    l "……好吧，都听你的，婕斯小姐。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1584
translate chinese ep7_b8d55a1b:

    # l "I wonder what actually happened..."
    l "不知道到底出什么事了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1588
translate chinese ep7_11e5f74c:

    # l "*removing her shoes* Well, it's not so bad, I guess. More study time for me."
    l "*脱鞋* 倒也正好。有更多时间学习了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1598
translate chinese ep7_5e1d008e:

    # l "......"
    l "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1601
translate chinese ep7_a93fc08d:

    # an "Hey!"
    an "嘿！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1602
translate chinese ep7_5963b108:

    # l "Yeah?"
    l "怎么了？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1605
translate chinese ep7_b7f60a34:

    # an "*tap* *tap*"
    an "*拍* *拍*"

# game/ep7.rpy:1606
translate chinese ep7_40033c03:

    # an "Relax and breath."
    an "放松，控制呼吸。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1613
translate chinese ep7_458f15da:

    # l "{i}Well, I guess completing this shoe collection is nothing but an unreachable dream now."
    l "{i}看来集齐这些鞋子现在也只是遥不可及的梦想了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1616
translate chinese ep7_5e1d008e_1:

    # l "......"
    l "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1637
translate chinese ep7_2bf0832b:

    # l "Urk~!"
    l "啊~！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1638
translate chinese ep7_0d6ee412:

    # l "{i}Why does it still hurt this bad even after so long?!"
    l "{i}过了这么久怎么还这么疼啊？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1648
translate chinese ep7_3b21f354_10:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1649
translate chinese ep7_2100b89b:

    # mc "I know this place. Isn't it plagued by addicts and drug dealers?"
    mc "我听说过这里。这里不全是毒贩和瘾君子吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1650
translate chinese ep7_90734600:

    # f "Is it? It looks peaceful to me though."
    f "是吗？我看这地方挺平静的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1653
translate chinese ep7_b6ed6c33:

    # m "It {b}was{/b}."
    m "{b}以前{/b}是你说的那样。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1654
translate chinese ep7_c0bb9aa2:

    # m "Until I came here."
    m "直到我来了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1655
translate chinese ep7_05500ff6:

    # mc "Huh?"
    mc "啊？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1656
translate chinese ep7_c4e13009:

    # m "I am nothing if not the sheriff in these parts."
    m "我是这一片的警长。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1659
translate chinese ep7_a3715bcf:

    # m "So while you're here, I suggest you refrain from making any stupid moves and do just what I say."
    m "所以你们在这里的时候，希望你们可以别做傻事，乖乖听我的话。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1660
translate chinese ep7_52200d5f:

    # m "My turf, my rules."
    m "在我地盘这儿就得听我的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1661
translate chinese ep7_bff4213d:

    # mc "What?! How can you be a sheriff while you're in college?!"
    mc "什么？！你还在上大学，怎么能当上警长啊？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1664
translate chinese ep7_ae1c3564:

    # j "It's not official, but the residents here like to call her that since she brought peace and order to this place."
    j "不是真的警长，只是她让这个地方重新有了和平和秩序，所以这里的人喜欢那么叫她。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1665
translate chinese ep7_c7149aba:

    # j "I don't need to tell you, but you'd better behave yourselves."
    j "你们也用不着我提醒，不过你们最好乖乖的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1668
translate chinese ep7_0fe9b3e7:

    # mc "Huh... She's... weird..."
    mc "啊……她……有点怪……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1669
translate chinese ep7_6b87d733:

    # j "She's a bit eccentric, but you'll get used to it, especially with the way she talks sometimes."
    j "她是有点怪，特别是有时候会说很奇怪的话，但你总会习惯的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1672
translate chinese ep7_6b1943ac:

    # mc "So you assigned her to be my servant? What for? And I don't get why..."
    mc "所以你派她来当我的仆人？为什么？我怎么也想不明白……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1673
translate chinese ep7_b2b56b3d:

    # mc "Not that I'm complaining though..."
    mc "倒也不是在抱怨……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1674
translate chinese ep7_9b8ec068:

    # j "You'll need her. Use her to your heart's content in addition to what you have right now."
    j "你会需要她的。不管你有什么需要，尽管吩咐她就好了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1675
translate chinese ep7_4d80c3e9:

    # mc "O...kay...?"
    mc "好……吧……？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1678
translate chinese ep7_81b88920:

    # m "Hurry up and get inside, I don't want you people standing there in broad daylight."
    m "快点，进去吧。别在大太阳下面站太久。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1688
translate chinese ep7_c3e3fa12:

    # j "Take her to her room, please, Fang. Thank you."
    j "麻烦你带她去我的房间，獠牙。谢谢你。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1691
translate chinese ep7_699dcd20:

    # m "Follow me."
    m "跟我来。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1695
translate chinese ep7_33e6b266:

    # a "We'll talk later, Frey."
    a "我们之后再聊，芙蕾。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1696
translate chinese ep7_6f0f8f72:

    # f "Alright, I'll call you?"
    f "好的，我给你打电话？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1697
translate chinese ep7_46c17595:

    # a "Sure!"
    a "当然可以！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1698
translate chinese ep7_3bb3fd20:

    # j "......"
    j "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1701
translate chinese ep7_27bfaae3:

    # j "Let me introduce to you..."
    j "来认识一下吧……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1702
translate chinese ep7_582359ea:

    # mc "Hm?"
    mc "嗯？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1705
translate chinese ep7_b6c2d632:

    # j "My people..."
    j "我的亲人……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1706
translate chinese ep7_6152b2cc:

    # j "My team..."
    j "我的团队……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1707
translate chinese ep7_1932a476:

    # j "My friends..."
    j "我的朋友……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1708
translate chinese ep7_7f91a03d:

    # j "And the members of our Clan..."
    j "以及我们氏族的所有成员……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1709
translate chinese ep7_f3b9a5f7:

    # j "{b}Your{/b} Clan."
    j "同时，也是{b}你的{/b}氏族。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1710
translate chinese ep7_ec2024e9:

    # mc "[landlady!t]?"
    mc "[landlady!t]？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1715
translate chinese ep7_2a1f75a9:

    # k "I'm sorry you have to go through this."
    k "抱歉，要让你经受这些。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1716
translate chinese ep7_4aefec0d:

    # k "No, I'm the one who put you into this situation."
    k "不，应该说是我让你变成现在这样的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1719
translate chinese ep7_b8888c5a:

    # mc "You intentionally made them live with me... right? Tell me the truth, [landlady!t]."
    mc "你故意让她们跟我住在一起的……对吧？跟我说实话，[landlady!t]。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1720
translate chinese ep7_b1a4d35c:

    # k "Yes, it wasn't Emma's plan, but mine."
    k "是的，那不是艾玛的主意，是我的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1723
translate chinese ep7_0da01199:

    # k "I fully understood that you'd finally moved on, but I needed you to learn something."
    k "我完全理解你已经放下过去了，但我需要你知道一些事情。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1724
translate chinese ep7_48e8f3ef:

    # k "Something that would allow you to open your eyes."
    k "能拓宽你的眼界的事情。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1725
translate chinese ep7_18191a74:

    # k "But still, I think I do owe you an apology."
    k "但是，我的确要向你道歉。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1726
translate chinese ep7_3b21f354_11:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1727
translate chinese ep7_b0cccf63:

    # mc "And I did realize something..."
    mc "我确实注意到了一些事……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1728
translate chinese ep7_1f89532c:

    # mc "But honestly, I'm conflicted..."
    mc "但说实话，我现在很纠结……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1729
translate chinese ep7_b1d7c110:

    # mc "A part of me wants to blame you for messing with my peace, but you are the reason I could meet Emy once more."
    mc "我有点想怪你打扰了我平静的生活，但也是因为你，我才能再见到艾米。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1730
translate chinese ep7_c371f297:

    # mc "I couldn’t have asked for a more perfect gift than that."
    mc "世上没有比这更好的礼物了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1731
translate chinese ep7_ea13dce5:

    # mc "You gave me a chance to correct my mistakes."
    mc "你给了我改正错误的机会。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1734
translate chinese ep7_e9510bdd:

    # k "All you young ones' mistakes, not just yours."
    k "是你们所有年轻人的错误，不是只有你的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1735
translate chinese ep7_5e44a000:

    # mc "Right..."
    mc "好吧……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1736
translate chinese ep7_80c95f13:

    # mc "However, I won't thank you just yet. We'll have our own conversation at a proper time."
    mc "但是，我还不会直接开始感谢你。之后我们会再找个时间好好谈谈。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1737
translate chinese ep7_a90afa0d:

    # mc "I'm not going to let my emotions control my actions."
    mc "我不会再让情绪控制我的行动了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1740
translate chinese ep7_88ae75e6:

    # k "Of course."
    k "当然。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1743
translate chinese ep7_4f2b8d5e:

    # mc "Right now, there is something I want to know."
    mc "现在，我有问题要问。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1744
translate chinese ep7_7731959a:

    # mc "Could you please enlighten me..."
    mc "能请你回答我吗……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1745
translate chinese ep7_6aeb352a:

    # mc "Jess?"
    mc "婕斯？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1746
translate chinese ep7_a661ff42:

    # yt "Wait, when did that woman enter here? I did not see her after she left the car."
    yt "等等，那个女的什么时候进来的？她下车之后我就没看见过她了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1749
translate chinese ep7_25911ca0:

    # j "Don't force yourself, [mc!t]. Just call me directly by my name, I have been telling you that since day one."
    j "不用强迫你自己，[mc!t]。直接叫我的名字就好了，我从一开始就是这么跟你说的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1750
translate chinese ep7_165b7fd4:

    # mc "Right, 'since day one'. Let's start from that."
    mc "对啊，“从一开始”，我们就从这开始说起吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1751
translate chinese ep7_4802e91d:

    # j "Before we start..."
    j "在开始之前……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1754
translate chinese ep7_3bb3fd20_1:

    # j "......"
    j "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1755
translate chinese ep7_be769682:

    # yt "Ah, shit. Here we go again."
    yt "行吧，又来了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1762
translate chinese ep7_2e64199e:

    # mc "Like I said, I know how to protect myself."
    mc "我也说了，我知道怎么保护自己。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1763
translate chinese ep7_b89bc172:

    # mc "I at least know how to dodge and block, you know? That was already the fifth time you did that since we met."
    mc "基本的格挡和闪避我还是会的。自打我们认识以来，这都是第五次了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1764
translate chinese ep7_8fa86f8f:

    # j "I know, I just needed to reaffirm something."
    j "我知道，我只是想再确认一遍。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1767
translate chinese ep7_dec5954d:

    # j "Well? Was that enough to prove it to you?"
    j "如何？这足够证明给你看了吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1768
translate chinese ep7_e9dfbaa9:

    # un "*chuckles* Yes. Go ahead."
    un "*笑* 当然。你继续。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1771
translate chinese ep7_fc971375:

    # j "Sorry for that."
    j "抱歉啊。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1772
translate chinese ep7_6e00966f:

    # mc "Hm, I'm already used to your games by now. Just tell me what I need to know."
    mc "嗯，我已经习惯你整的这出了。把我想知道的事告诉我就好。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1775
translate chinese ep7_4b83f2d4:

    # j "Like I told Klara..."
    j "我跟克拉拉也说过……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1776
translate chinese ep7_9900f33b:

    # j "You... are Georgia's remaining collateral descendants who I swore to protect while standing at her grave."
    j "你……是乔治亚剩下为数不多的亲人了，是我在她墓前发誓要保护的人。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1777
translate chinese ep7_4e0c3a36:

    # j "I had been searching for you after she died."
    j "我在她死后一直在找你。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1778
translate chinese ep7_16f2fb2e:

    # j "I eventually found you and decided to bring you into one of my businesses."
    j "找到你之后，我就决定把你带进我名下的产业里。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1779
translate chinese ep7_95c5f30b:

    # j "The purpose was not to give you a job, but instead to protect you from possible individuals that could see you as a target until I could confirm that our problem was over."
    j "目的不是为了给你工作，而是在我能确定问题都解决完了之前，让你不被潜在的危险盯上。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1780
translate chinese ep7_9f9f4c8d:

    # mc "But what for? I'm just an ordinary guy as far as I know."
    mc "但为什么啊？我觉得我只是个普通人而已。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1781
translate chinese ep7_0bcb33c4:

    # j "As far as you know, [mc!t]."
    j "那是你觉得，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1782
translate chinese ep7_d791f162:

    # j "But honestly, I must commend Klara for doing such an excellent job of keeping you all hidden in those times."
    j "不过说实话，我必须称赞克拉拉，她一直以来都把你隐藏得非常好。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1785
translate chinese ep7_41f92ffb:

    # mc "You know about this?"
    mc "你全都知道？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1786
translate chinese ep7_71df63fd:

    # k "Yes, dear."
    k "是的，亲爱的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1787
translate chinese ep7_88f2d796:

    # k "Georgia and I were daughters of an assassin intelligence officer."
    k "我和乔治亚都是一个刺客组织的情报官的女儿。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1788
translate chinese ep7_9cc56882:

    # k "She took her place in the organization, but I decided to get myself out while I could."
    k "她后来也加入了组织，但我决定在我牵扯太深之前脱身。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1789
translate chinese ep7_b36b2548:

    # k "It was a gamble, but I wanted a better future. So I left everything, including all the power I could've had."
    k "那是一场豪赌，不过我想要个更好的未来。所以我抛下了一切，包括那些我可能获得的权力。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1790
translate chinese ep7_486be930:

    # k "In exchange, that allowed me to live as an ordinary individual."
    k "作为交换，我能作为一个普通人生活了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1791
translate chinese ep7_cb6a2343:

    # k "Keeping the information from you and Sky was the best I could do to keep your lives normal."
    k "为了让你和斯凯能过上普通的日子，我最好的选择就是把一切都瞒着不告诉你们。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1792
translate chinese ep7_f777156c:

    # k "If I had not escaped from that destiny, I would be dead by now and you wouldn't be standing here either."
    k "如果我当初没有离开的话，我现在也早就已经死了，你也不会站在这了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1795
translate chinese ep7_bf961a3b:

    # mc "I see... Assassins, huh...?"
    mc "我明白了……刺客……？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1796
translate chinese ep7_b32c412c:

    # mc "I couldn't imagine those kinds of people actually exist."
    mc "我简直没法想象那种人是真实存在的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1799
translate chinese ep7_2fdd7b16:

    # j "We've got a few in this room who can confirm it to you."
    j "这里就站着好几位刺客，可以向你证明。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1800
translate chinese ep7_18484062:

    # mc "What?! These people are your team, right? Then you're..."
    mc "什么？！这些人不是跟你一伙的吗？那你也……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1803
translate chinese ep7_4fefde7a:

    # y "Oh boy... You are too innocent for this."
    y "天啊……你真的什么都不知道啊。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1805
translate chinese ep7_21055ef0:

    # cl "Heeh~! Since when did you get so talkative?"
    cl "嘿~！你什么时候这么爱说话了？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1808
translate chinese ep7_71febcb8:

    # y "Don't talk to me, bitch. I'm still watching you, just so you know."
    y "别跟我说话，婊子。我还是时刻盯着你呢。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1810
translate chinese ep7_eb32632f:

    # cl "Urmph! God, I would love to hear that voice scream my name~!"
    cl "哈！天啊，真想听你用那声音尖叫出我的名字啊~！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1811
translate chinese ep7_88d9682f:

    # y "Shut up!"
    y "闭嘴！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1814
translate chinese ep7_006c7377:

    # li "Oh please... cut this out before it gets too noisy."
    li "拜托……别那么聒噪好不好。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1817
translate chinese ep7_779692da:

    # ka "Like you are one to talk, Lisa."
    ka "你最没资格说这话吧，丽莎。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1818
translate chinese ep7_47087575:

    # li "Huh?!"
    li "啊？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1821
translate chinese ep7_b33a6b8d:

    # un "That's enough, let the new guy have his moment, will you?"
    un "够了，让新人好好静静，行吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1822
translate chinese ep7_c51b1ab9:

    # j "And there's your answer."
    j "这就是你想要的答案了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1825
translate chinese ep7_e75f6778:

    # mc "Kana?! You're also one of them?!"
    mc "卡娜？！连你也是？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1828
translate chinese ep7_a3ca5ab6:

    # ka "Uh-huh? I'm Georgia's daughter, you know?"
    ka "对啊？我可是乔治亚的女儿啊？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1831
translate chinese ep7_87d3158a:

    # mc "You knew about this too?!"
    mc "这个你也知道？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1832
translate chinese ep7_308e069e:

    # k "Not until they arrived here and introduced themselves to me, no."
    k "在他们来这向我做自我介绍之前，我是不知道的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1833
translate chinese ep7_ecbda53a:

    # k "I was shocked to learn about this too. I didn't have a single clue that Georgia's Clan was still thriving."
    k "我知道的时候也很惊讶。我根本没想到乔治亚的氏族居然还在运作。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1836
translate chinese ep7_68845eb9:

    # k "Does that mean there is still something happening in this City?"
    k "这是代表城里还有风波没有平息吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1837
translate chinese ep7_3bb3fd20_2:

    # j "......"
    j "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1840
translate chinese ep7_fe702c7c:

    # j "Would you like to explain this yourself before you go?"
    j "你走之前要不要亲自解释一下？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1841
translate chinese ep7_696c8a25:

    # un "Well, sure, why not?"
    un "好吧，也是。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1844
translate chinese ep7_4dbd4639:

    # mc "Whoa... What's with the eyepatch, buddy?"
    mc "我说……这眼罩是什么情况，伙计？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1847
translate chinese ep7_3be9f8fe:

    # un "......"
    un "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1859
translate chinese ep7_79fcba86:

    # un "Nothing but a small price paid in order to untie a hitch."
    un "只是为了解决一个问题而付出的小小代价而已。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1862
translate chinese ep7_a03c69f0:

    # un "To answer your question..."
    un "关于你的问题……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1863
translate chinese ep7_34490e74:

    # un "A lot of blood was spilled, but everything was over two years ago."
    un "流了很多血，但一切都在两年前结束了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1864
translate chinese ep7_9f03ba8d:

    # un "Right now, we are just trying to live the lives we all wanted."
    un "现在，我们只是在试着过我们想要的生活。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1865
translate chinese ep7_99dae9b5:

    # un "Or... well... to help Jess with her businesses."
    un "或者……嗯……帮婕斯打理生意。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1866
translate chinese ep7_e0d5ca7f:

    # un "I haven't held a knife for a long time myself, unless it's in the kitchen, of course."
    un "除了在厨房里，我已经很久没有拿过刀了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1869
translate chinese ep7_e1ffd72e:

    # un "As for you..."
    un "至于你……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1870
translate chinese ep7_5369ef6f:

    # un "Jess might have told you about risks or whatnot, but all of those are in the past."
    un "婕斯可能跟你说过风险之类的事情，但那都是过去式了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1879
translate chinese ep7_7cc768c5:

    # un "We simply took precautionary actions in order to keep you people safe, not to use or control you."
    un "我们只是为了确保你们的安全做了些预警措施，没想过利用、控制你们。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1880
translate chinese ep7_1134910a:

    # un "You are still really a part of my Clan, after all."
    un "毕竟你也算是我的氏族的一份子。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1881
translate chinese ep7_3e13370f:

    # un "Now that you know everything there is to know about yourself, don't go and brag about it out there, will you?"
    un "现在你知道你到底是什么身份了，可别出去到处炫耀。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1882
translate chinese ep7_836abb2d:

    # un "Just a piece of advice from me."
    un "这是我给你的建议。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1883
translate chinese ep7_46801464:

    # un "Also just to clarify, this is your story now..."
    un "还有，跟你说清楚，现在开始就是你的故事了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1884
translate chinese ep7_50b7fa01:

    # un "You may be under my Clan, but we won't be moving just because you need us to."
    un "你确实是我氏族的人，但我们可不会因为你需要就给你办事。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1885
translate chinese ep7_a35001b5:

    # un "We're just here to let you know about your identity."
    un "我们来这只是为了让你知道你的真实身份。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1886
translate chinese ep7_214a55b3:

    # un "That is selfish of me, I know. But this is to prevent you from getting drunk on your newfound power."
    un "我这样很自私，我知道。不过这也是为了防止你太沉迷你新得到的权力。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1887
translate chinese ep7_20415db5:

    # un "I hope you understand what I'm trying to say."
    un "希望你明白我的意思。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1888
translate chinese ep7_c4f77dfa:

    # mc "I get it, I'm not that kind of person."
    mc "我懂，我不是那种人。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1889
translate chinese ep7_06ae4a00:

    # un "Good, I'm glad to hear that."
    un "很好，你这么说我很高兴。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1892
translate chinese ep7_208a6147:

    # un "And I guess... he already has everything he needs?"
    un "我想……他已经有了他需要的一切了吧？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1893
translate chinese ep7_f3cd14d6:

    # j "I think so, but only he can say for sure."
    j "我也这么觉得，但还是只有他最清楚。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1896
translate chinese ep7_5e9fe091:

    # mc "......."
    mc "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1899
translate chinese ep7_00b19260:

    # mc "*chuckles* Yeah... I already have that."
    mc "*笑* 是啊……我已经有了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1900
translate chinese ep7_6e322624:

    # un "I like that smile."
    un "你这个微笑我很中意。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1903
translate chinese ep7_178a9db4:

    # un "Now that we got our part settled, it is time for us to go."
    un "既然我们的部分搞定了，我们也该走了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1904
translate chinese ep7_845edc0d:

    # un "We'll leave you guys to discuss about your personal matters."
    un "不打扰你们谈你们的私事了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1905
translate chinese ep7_09b87eb6:

    # mc "Oh... Alright."
    mc "噢……好的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1906
translate chinese ep7_eb06bae2:

    # un "Don't worry, this isn't the last time. We'll definitely see each other again at some point."
    un "没事，这不会是最后一次的。我们之后肯定还会再见面的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1907
translate chinese ep7_05300c0b:

    # mc "I'm looking forward to knowing more about you, then."
    mc "那我很期待能再多了解你一些。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1908
translate chinese ep7_71873096:

    # un "I'll be glad to tell you my story when the time comes."
    un "等到时机成熟，我很乐意把我的故事告诉你。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1909
translate chinese ep7_9a9572af:

    # un "And..."
    un "还有……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1912
translate chinese ep7_4bee47c0:

    # un "*whispers* Gotta get them all, don't you think?"
    un "*低语* 得把她们全给收了，你觉得呢？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1914
translate chinese ep7_f46823e8:

    # j "Pff..."
    j "哈……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1917
translate chinese ep7_c3f7c08c:

    # mc "Oh man... What are you?"
    mc "兄弟……你搞什么啊？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1918
translate chinese ep7_1bf12371:

    # un "Ahaha!"
    un "啊哈哈！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1921
translate chinese ep7_38e1c970:

    # un "Anyway, good luck."
    un "总之，祝你好运。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1922
translate chinese ep7_a64e8bc0_1:

    # mc "Thanks."
    mc "谢谢。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1932
translate chinese ep7_3bf4ea65:

    # a "H-Hello, Miss Klara."
    a "你-你好，克拉拉太太。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1933
translate chinese ep7_53f8c88c:

    # a "I'm Aine, [mc!t]'s g-g-girl..."
    a "我是艾妮，[mc!t]的女-女-女……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1934
translate chinese ep7_76a37405:

    # a "I mean..."
    a "呃，那个……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1935
translate chinese ep7_72c49a4a:

    # a "N-no, nevermind that."
    a "没-没事，当我没说。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1936
translate chinese ep7_761974b1:

    # k "Ah, so you are that girl, hm?"
    k "啊，所以你就是那个女生？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1937
translate chinese ep7_9fbca673:

    # k "I can see why [mc!t] was so into you."
    k "看得出来为什么[mc!t]当时那么喜欢你。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1938
translate chinese ep7_2d283425:

    # a "H-huh?"
    a "什-什么？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1942
translate chinese ep7_3bb3fd20_3:

    # j "......"
    j "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1943
translate chinese ep7_3b21f354_12:

    # mc "......"
    mc "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1944
translate chinese ep7_1ae87d92:

    # a "{i}The atmosphere suddenly got so tense... It's scary."
    a "{i}气氛突然好紧张……有点吓人。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1945
translate chinese ep7_ba01dec8:

    # k "Well? What happened back there? You've been silent since they left."
    k "你们找赫拉都说什么了？他们走之后你就一直没说话。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1948
translate chinese ep7_353cc225:

    # mc "You have to know something about Jovian, [landlady!t]."
    mc "你肯定知道有关乔维安的事吧，[landlady!t]。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1949
translate chinese ep7_56888f44:

    # k "My... Please don't bring up your [landlord!t] like that, dear. He's-"
    k "……请别这么突然提到你[landlord!t]，亲爱的。他已经——"

# game/ep7.rpy:1950
translate chinese ep7_ddda2fe1:

    # mc "No, he's responsible for us being in this situation."
    mc "不，我们现在变成这样都是他的责任。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1951
translate chinese ep7_8fb4bc5d:

    # k "But he's dead, [mc!t]. How can he..."
    k "但他已经死了，[mc!t]。他怎么可能……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1952
translate chinese ep7_8067a407:

    # mc "He's not dead, he made us look like a fool standing on his motherfucking grave."
    mc "他没有死，他让我们站在他墓前的样子就他妈的像傻子一样。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1953
translate chinese ep7_667519fa:

    # mc "He's still somewhere out there, hiding. Or at least, as far as we know."
    mc "他依然躲在什么地方。至少根据目前已知的情况来说是这样的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1954
translate chinese ep7_de021b16:

    # mc "There's no certainty if he's actually still alive."
    mc "不能确定他到底是不是还活着。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1957
translate chinese ep7_1564c7e7:

    # k "...!!!"
    k "……！！！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1958
translate chinese ep7_9053d1af:

    # mc "Listen..."
    mc "听好了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1967
translate chinese ep7_721fff29_1:

    # k "......"
    k "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1968
translate chinese ep7_6b3f35ad:

    # k ".........."
    k "…………"

# game/ep7.rpy:1972
translate chinese ep7_2c957398:

    # yt "Yeah, that's the reaction I expected from her."
    yt "我就知道她会是这种反应。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1973
translate chinese ep7_d8221742:

    # yt "She has this inner tomboy that can come out and seem rude towards others when she is stressed or angry."
    yt "她在压力大或者生气的时候就会展现出这样男性化、有些粗鲁的一面。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1974
translate chinese ep7_1291360f:

    # yt "It's been a while..."
    yt "已经有一段时间没见过了……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1975
translate chinese ep7_b5a5ef6e:

    # yt "Honestly, I don't want to get on this side of her too much, it's dangerous."
    yt "老实说，我不想让她这个样子太久，很危险。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1978
translate chinese ep7_1ec4b3de:

    # mc "So, does everything... makes sense to you? Because it does to me."
    mc "那么，这一切……你觉得说得通吗？我觉得完全说得通。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1981
translate chinese ep7_50e0fff7:

    # cl "She wasn't lying either, just to let you know."
    cl "我插一句，赫拉没有说谎。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1982
translate chinese ep7_61a19a73:

    # cl "Her emotions were real: there wasn't any hesitation with the way she told you the story."
    cl "她的情绪都是真的：她在讲故事的时候没有丝毫的犹豫。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1983
translate chinese ep7_7f1fa15d:

    # cl "I can vouch that she was telling the truth."
    cl "我可以证明她说的都是实话。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1986
translate chinese ep7_f8e8e9df:

    # k "...If that is true, then I don't understand why Hera would use our rivalry as an excuse to get to me."
    k "……如果是那样的话，那我不能理解为什么赫拉要用我们之间的旧事做借口来找我。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1987
translate chinese ep7_5b688074:

    # k "Why does she have to bring it up if she let us be in the first place?"
    k "如果她当初选择了成全我们的话，干嘛还要提我们俩和乔维安的事？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1990
translate chinese ep7_10f9aba1:

    # mc "We can consider four reasons for that..."
    mc "可能的原因有四个……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1991
translate chinese ep7_429e2dbf:

    # mc "One, to put up a strong face."
    mc "第一，装强硬给人看。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1992
translate chinese ep7_7814926f:

    # mc "Two, she's lying."
    mc "第二，她在撒谎。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1993
translate chinese ep7_4ba7b822:

    # mc "Those two are bullshit, by the way."
    mc "对了，这两个原因是我在瞎鸡巴胡扯。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1996
translate chinese ep7_2e87cae1:

    # a "Language, [mc!t]!"
    a "别说脏话，[mc!t]！"

# game/ep7.rpy:1999
translate chinese ep7_032e3c9f:

    # j "You two make a good couple, you know that?"
    j "你们俩可真是天生一对。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2002
translate chinese ep7_79cd5720:

    # mc "Three... like her daughter here..."
    mc "第三……就像她女儿一样……"

# game/ep7.rpy:2003
translate chinese ep7_d5de49ad:

    # mc "She has become someone else's puppet..."
    mc "她也成了别人的傀儡……"

# game/ep7.rpy:2004
translate chinese ep7_ce5e9bc6:

    # mc "Or four... All of the above."
    mc "或者第四……以上三个原因全都有。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2005
translate chinese ep7_457c19f9:

    # a "Huh?!"
    a "什么？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:2006
translate chinese ep7_686b124e:

    # a "There's no way she would-"
    a "她根本不可能会——"

# game/ep7.rpy:2007
translate chinese ep7_3c7c19d8:

    # mc "Calm down, it's just a hypothesis."
    mc "冷静，只是假设而已。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2008
translate chinese ep7_c6fe294b:

    # mc "But did she ever tell you to do anything after we graduated from high school?"
    mc "但她在我们高中毕业之后，有继续给你下命令吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2009
translate chinese ep7_73e66456:

    # a "No, she didn't. That was the time when I slowly started to move out."
    a "没有。我也是从那时候开始慢慢逃走的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2010
translate chinese ep7_8b07d1f2:

    # mc "And she let you do it without saying anything?"
    mc "那她什么也没说，也不管你？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2013
translate chinese ep7_a3f6149c:

    # h "Do whatever you want, I don't need you anymore."
    h "随便你干嘛，我已经不需要你了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2016
translate chinese ep7_1228cb5b:

    # a "That's... what she said."
    a "她是……那么说的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2019
translate chinese ep7_d4cd93fd:

    # mc "See?"
    mc "你看吧？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2020
translate chinese ep7_4d28c5f8:

    # mc "She could've made you follow me to the same college to start more shit if she really wanted to get to me."
    mc "她真想整我的话，完全可以让你跟我去同一所大学，再搞点更多的乱子出来的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2021
translate chinese ep7_dcb1fedd:

    # mc "Now the question is... Why?"
    mc "现在问题就是……为什么？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2022
translate chinese ep7_1a525b2c:

    # mc "Why did she stop?"
    mc "为什么她停下了？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2023
translate chinese ep7_dbfea283:

    # mc "She got bored or something?"
    mc "她觉得无聊了？还是什么？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2024
translate chinese ep7_f64b40df:

    # mc "I don't think so..."
    mc "我可不这么想……"

# game/ep7.rpy:2027
translate chinese ep7_84bc9541:

    # j "I suggest you all to give it a rest for now. Let it sink in and think about what you want to do next."
    j "我建议你们现在先休息吧。好好消化一下，想想下一步要怎么做。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2028
translate chinese ep7_e0137514:

    # j "Especially you, [mc!t]."
    j "特别是你，[mc!t]。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2031
translate chinese ep7_61127d63:

    # k "Yes, I..."
    k "是的，我……"

# game/ep7.rpy:2032
translate chinese ep7_057c7307:

    # k "This is a bit too much for me... I don't even know what to say."
    k "我有点承受不住了……我都不知道该说什么了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2033
translate chinese ep7_8ccd78b8:

    # k "I just can't believe that... Jovian..."
    k "我没法相信……乔维安他……"

# game/ep7.rpy:2034
translate chinese ep7_842a2f08:

    # mc "That's enough for now, [landlady!t]."
    mc "不用再想了，[landlady!t]。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2035
translate chinese ep7_840763ca:

    # mc "It is what it is, this is where we are now."
    mc "事已至此，我们没法改变。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2036
translate chinese ep7_08b58761:

    # mc "Do we make a move, or let it be? That's the question."
    mc "是要做出行动，还是就此结束？这才是问题。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2039
translate chinese ep7_7b460e04:

    # j "Only you can answer that. The rest will be up to you from now on."
    j "这个问题只有你能回答。从现在开始，剩下的都要交给你了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2040
translate chinese ep7_039dcfbc:

    # j "I'm pretty much done with what I have to do, all that's left for me is to help Klara with her company."
    j "我能做的都已经做完了，剩下的只有帮克拉拉处理她的公司的事了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2041
translate chinese ep7_0d0cc581:

    # j "Whatever you want to do, stand up for it like a man."
    j "不管你想做什么，都要像个男人一样去面对。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2042
translate chinese ep7_e55b9a70_4:

    # yt "......"
    yt "……"

# game/ep7.rpy:2043
translate chinese ep7_5a18e86b:

    # yt "Emy..."
    yt "艾米……"

# game/ep7.rpy:2046
translate chinese ep7_135ea619:

    # mc "So you want me to stay here with you?"
    mc "你想让我留在这陪你吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2047
translate chinese ep7_5ac2c369:

    # k "Oh, no no. You still have something to do, don't you?"
    k "噢，不，不用。你肯定还有事要做吧？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2048
translate chinese ep7_78dc6314:

    # k "I'm coming home in a day or two, don't worry. Then... we can talk alone."
    k "我过两天就回家了，不用担心。之后……我们可以单独谈谈。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2049
translate chinese ep7_fef6570b:

    # k "But please, don't tell Sky anything about this for now."
    k "但拜托你，先什么都不要跟斯凯提。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2050
translate chinese ep7_4ed67123:

    # k "I already know how she will react, so I want to be the one to tell her."
    k "我已经知道她会怎么反应了，所以我想亲口告诉她。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2051
translate chinese ep7_9b11dfe2:

    # k "Just... give me some time to collect myself..."
    k "先……给我一些时间缓缓……"

# game/ep7.rpy:2052
translate chinese ep7_2a5e70ea:

    # mc "Alright, if that's what you want."
    mc "好吧，听你的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2053
translate chinese ep7_b1186293:

    # mc "We'll be waiting then."
    mc "那我们等你回来。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2056
translate chinese ep7_d2f6ea8b:

    # j "You might want to talk to Fang before you leave, maybe to clarify things?"
    j "走之前要不再跟獠牙说几句，把事情弄清楚？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2057
translate chinese ep7_21251d3b:

    # mc "Oh yeah, I will do that."
    mc "好啊，我会的。"

