    g "但那两个人是傻子。有时候，只有够傻，才会有足够的勇气去做别人做不到的事。"

# game/ep7.rpy:478
translate chinese ep7_0d4bc516:

    # j "I may carry the last name, but I am, in fact, not a part of it."
    j "我确实是这个家族的人，但是跟黑手党没一点关系。"

# game/ep7.rpy:495
translate chinese ep7_cf646dcb:

    # mc "I don't have an informant, but I'm not that stupid, Jess."
    mc "没人跟我说，但我也不傻，婕斯。"

# game/ep7.rpy:499
translate chinese ep7_3c6dc8b6:

    # mc "And now, why do I feel that you have been waiting for this chance? I can hear the eagerness in your voice."
    mc "还有现在，我怎么感觉你一直在等这个机会呢？我听得出来，你的声音很兴奋。"

# game/ep7.rpy:524
translate chinese ep7_c1950f1e:

    # mc "I know this won't go that easy {b}if{/b} this so-called Mafia actually exists. So I need men to protect us while we are in there."
    mc "{b}假如{/b}这个所谓的黑手党真的存在的话，那事情肯定不会很简单。我需要有人在我们跟赫拉对质的时候保护我们。"

# game/ep7.rpy:544
translate chinese ep7_56a3c7ce:

    # mc "I'm looking forward to that."
    mc "我很期待。"

# game/ep7.rpy:571
translate chinese ep7_076d935f:

    # j "Once this is over, why don't you go back home for a while? Spend some time with them and get rid of all your stubbornness."
    j "这之后，你干脆回家住一段怎么样？多陪陪他们，别老是这么固执了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:670
translate chinese ep7_45214cb6:

    # cl "But to be fair, you're different from all of them, and that is not an insult."
    cl "不过说实话，你跟他们都不一样，并且我的意思也不是在损你。"

# game/ep7.rpy:821
translate chinese ep7_ab54d0a4:

    # mc "Yes, it is nice to finally meet you, Hera."
    mc "是啊，终于能见到你了，赫拉。"

# game/ep7.rpy:846
translate chinese ep7_f70b4b6b:

    # f "Hm? What's with all the commotion out there?"
    f "嗯？外面在闹什么呢？"

# game/ep7.rpy:908
translate chinese ep7_65159504:

    # k "What?! Did you forget what the professor said yesterday?!"
    k "什么？！你忘了老师昨天怎么说的吗？！"

# game/ep7.rpy:981
translate chinese ep7_b39f524d:

    # ri "Well, even though I was just a simple man without any knowledge of your family, your father accepted me for who I am."
    ri "嗯，尽管我只是个对你家的事一无所知的普通人，你爸爸还是接受了这样的我。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1219
translate chinese ep7_796fa47a:

    # h "From the moment you were born... I knew you would follow in your father's footsteps. Kindness was always the answer."
    h "从你出生那天开始……我就知道你和你爸爸一模一样。永远都是个善良的人。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1375
translate chinese ep7_304211c9:

    # h "What you have here are a deranged assassin and an eccentric ex-mili-"
    h "这两位一个是精神失常的刺客，一个是古怪的退役军——"

# game/ep7.rpy:1391
translate chinese ep7_150adb69:

    # j "I guess you can say that, yes. I was a tad too late, but I must maintain his well-being."
    j "可以这么说吧。我找到他的时候已经有点晚了，不过我必须确保他能幸福生活。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1736
translate chinese ep7_177fd2a4:

    # mc "However, I won't thank you just yet. We'll have our conversation at a proper time."
    mc "但是，我还不会直接开始感谢你。之后我们会再找个时间好好谈谈。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1750
translate chinese ep7_22eda43e:

    # mc "Right, since day one. Let's start from that."
    mc "对啊，“从一开始”，我们就从这开始说起吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1762
translate chinese ep7_a879a160:

    # mc "As I said, I know how to protect myself."
    mc "我也说了，我知道怎么保护自己。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1859
translate chinese ep7_ac5c4194:

    # un "Nothing but a small price paid to untie a hitch."
    un "只是为了解决一个问题而付出的小小代价而已。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1879
translate chinese ep7_3fd224a0:

    # un "We simply took precautionary actions to keep you people safe, not to use or control you."
    un "我们只是为了确保你们的安全做了些预警措施，没想过利用、控制你们。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1904
translate chinese ep7_97805d32:

    # un "We'll leave you guys to discuss your personal matters."
    un "不打扰你们谈你们的私事了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1935
translate chinese ep7_fa591e06:

    # a "N-no, never mind that."
    a "没-没事，当我没说。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1952
translate chinese ep7_8148f491:

    # mc "He's not dead, he made us look like fools standing on his motherfucking grave."
    mc "他没有死，他让我们站在他墓前的样子就他妈的像傻子一样。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1978
translate chinese ep7_e2211c13:

    # mc "So, does everything... make sense to you? Because it does to me."
    mc "那么，这一切……你觉得说得通吗？我觉得完全说得通。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2027
translate chinese ep7_6f455c37:

    # j "I suggest you all give it a rest for now. Let it sink in and think about what you want to do next."
    j "我建议你们现在先休息吧。好好消化一下，想想下一步要怎么做。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2047
translate chinese ep7_c48a9eea:

    # k "Oh, no, no. You still have something to do, don't you?"
    k "噢，不，不用。你肯定还有事要做吧？"

# game/ep7.rpy:2269
translate chinese moonpause2_2e979c75:

    # mc "Come here for a moment. There's something I want to talk to you about for a bit."
    mc "过来一下。我有话要跟你说。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2302
translate chinese moonpause2_8ff9ef9c:

    # mc "The moment I saw Emma's letters and our photo back then, something clicked and a lot of memories came rushing into my brain, then all the dots were connected."
    mc "但就从我看到艾玛的信和我们的合照的那一刻开始，我感觉一下子就想通了，很多记忆在我的脑子里复现，所有的一切都连起来了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2431
translate chinese moonpause2_8819e60a:

    # mc "She's on the veranda."
    mc "她在外面。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2491
translate chinese moonpause2_b42e9b38:

    # e "Either way, we wouldn't have been able to if it wasn't for Miss Klara. She was the one who permitted us to come here."
    e "不管怎么样，要不是克拉拉太太，我们都没法过来的。是她允许我们搬过来的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2515
translate chinese moonpause2_380437db:

    # mc "Because I would've stormed in there all by myself if I knew about it sooner."
    mc "因为我要是更早一点知道的话，就会气到一个人跑去找她了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2744
translate chinese emmaxmcfirst_55bd4df5:

    # e "Emy has been such a bad girl, please punish her little pussy like what she deserves!"
    e "艾米是个坏女孩，请好好惩罚一下她的小骚逼吧~！"

# game/ep7.rpy:2993
translate chinese emmarevert_b356a54e:

    # mc "I want to run away with you. Runaway from all this."
    mc "我想和你私奔。把这一切事情都丢下不管。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3009
translate chinese emmarevert_4b8a1027:

    # mc "Me, [landlady], Aine, Hera, and you became victims of his actions."
    mc "我，[landlady!t]，艾妮，赫拉，还有你，都成了他做的事的受害者。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3036
translate chinese emmarevert_580c28fa:

    # mc "I don't want to lie to you, so I'm going to confess."
    mc "我不想对你撒谎，所以我要跟你坦白一些事。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3115
translate chinese emmarevert_580c28fa_1:

    # mc "I don't want to lie to you, so I'm going to confess."
    mc "我不想对你撒谎，所以我要跟你坦白一些事。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3185
translate chinese emmarevert_580c28fa_2:

    # mc "I don't want to lie to you, so I'm going to confess."
    mc "我不想对你撒谎，所以我要跟你坦白一些事。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3353
translate chinese emmarevert_d4a5f0d8:

    # yt "But enough thinking of my shit."
    yt "好了，不想我自己的事了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3525
translate chinese emmarevert_d0276c22:

    # mc "I know her, she's... extremely soft at heart and that's kind of a double-edged sword."
    mc "我了解她，她……内心特别柔软，这算是把双刃剑……"

# game/ep7.rpy:3564
translate chinese emmarevert_6f9d7a9b:

    # g "Your love and honesty are all that matters to me."
    g "你的爱和坦诚对我来说才是最重要的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3916
translate chinese gwenpause3_e7a07f34:

    # yt "I have a bad feeling about this guy..."
    yt "我感觉那个人不是什么好东西……"

# game/ep7.rpy:3933
translate chinese gwenpause3_9e72d704:

    # j "However, we will need a few more brains at work, so your help will be appreciated."
    j "不过，我们也用得上更多能出主意的人，所以你们的帮助肯定很有必要。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3938
translate chinese gwenpause3_561f1ccd:

    # e "You can gain the power to keep everyone safe when it's needed."
    e "你可以获得权力，这样在必要的时候就能保护大家了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3945
translate chinese gwenpause3_fa2f6e2a:

    # mc "I can plan ahead and keep everyone safe as much as I can."
    mc "我可以提前计划，尽可能地确保每个人都能平安。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4084
translate chinese gwenpause3_8e8e0321:

    # j "Now, I know you want to find your [landlord], but take it easy, and don't forget that you are all still young."
    j "我知道你想找你[landlord!t]，但慢慢来就好，别忘了你们现在都还很年轻呢。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4165
translate chinese gwenpause3_3a80cddc:

    # mc "I spent almost all my savings on this ring! Don't you dare take it off your finger!"
    mc "我的积蓄几乎全都拿来买这个戒指了！你最好永远都别给我摘下来！"

# game/ep7.rpy:4205
translate chinese gwenpause3_7238734e:

    # mc "Well, whatever... As long as it will benefit us both, I don't care about those rules."
    mc "管他呢……只要对我们两个有好处，我也不在乎什么规矩。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4238
translate chinese gwenpause3_6e0432cf:

    # a "It's not that bad."
    a "也没有那么糟糕。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4285
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_a2a89c8f:

    # yt "Goddamn, I don't want to push her too much but she's making me want to go all the way!"
    yt "天啊，我没想逼她太狠，但现在她让我只想一路做到底了！"

# game/ep7.rpy:4321
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_009496fd:

    # yt "Yeah, she has something for me."
    yt "没错，她对我有感觉。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4380
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_414d8ea3:

    # a "Don't just laugh at me! I don't know what to do~!"
    a "别光笑我！我不知道该怎么办了~！"

# game/ep7.rpy:4382
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_a7b3e825:

    # f "How the hell do you not know? You're such a noob, it's pretty simple!"
    f "你怎么可能不知道？怎么这么笨啊，明明这么简单的事！"

# game/ep7.rpy:4418
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_b64ccac8:

    # k "You don't have to hide it from me, dear, I can tell. I'm a grown-up woman, after all."
    k "你不用瞒着我的，亲爱的，我能看出来。毕竟我是过来人了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4433
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_ac0010b6:

    # a "So there were times when I was searching for it."
    a "所以有时候我会寻求他的慰藉。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4435
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_353f71da:

    # k "Then there's your answer, dear. But it's only you who can know what it is."
    k "这就是你的答案了，亲爱的。但只有你才知道你到底是怎么想的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4442
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_6ab01695:

    # k "We each have our ways; you'll just have to find yours."
    k "我们都有自己的路；你也要找到你的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4481
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_6e24cfb2:

    # yt "Now that it's happening, it really is awkward."
    yt "她真来了，倒还挺尴尬的。"
