    # mc "... Are you guys using me?"
    mc "你们是在利用我吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:500
translate chinese ep7_c7e38970:

    # j "Well, well... Aren't you a sharp one."
    j "哈哈，可以啊……你还挺聪明的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:510
translate chinese ep7_cd3daed7:

    # j "I bet you and Klara, might want to have a good talk as well."
    j "我想你和你克拉拉有不少话想说吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:517
translate chinese ep7_e2f6f853:

    # j "Although, you sound exactly like someone I know. You're not dropping your guard that easily, I like it."
    j "不过，你说起话来跟我认识的某个人一模一样。你不会轻易放下防备，我喜欢。"

# game/ep7.rpy:518
translate chinese ep7_1876cdb0:

    # j "... Very well."
    j "……好吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:543
translate chinese ep7_efe1c587:

    # j "Go easy on her, will you?"
    j "对她温柔点，好吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:553
translate chinese ep7_5b7a00a0:

    # k "I know my responsibility."
    k "我知道我身上的责任。"

# game/ep7.rpy:570
translate chinese ep7_e68c6374:

    # k "... I still don't fully understand why are you so eager to help us with our situation, Jess."
    k "……我还是没法完全理解为什么你这么急着帮我们，婕斯。"

# game/ep7.rpy:574
translate chinese ep7_4b9cfa9d:

    # j "You and Sky... are Georgia's collateral descendants that I swore to protect at her graveside."
    j "而你和斯凯……是乔治亚的亲人，是我在她墓前发誓要保护的人。"

# game/ep7.rpy:575
translate chinese ep7_c2edfc30:

    # j "All of you are blinded by your pasts. And my boy is caught in the middle of it. So, my role is to bring light to your eyes."
    j "你们全都被过去蒙蔽了双眼。而[mc!t]被困在风暴的正中心。所以，我的任务就是让你们重新看清真相。"

# game/ep7.rpy:882
translate chinese ep7_81241915:

    # h "Klara and I used to be close friends."
    h "克拉拉和我曾经是很亲密的朋友。"

# game/ep7.rpy:883
translate chinese ep7_4ba65d53:

    # h "... No, we were {b}best friends{/b}."
    h "……不，我跟她曾经是{b}最好的朋友{/b}。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1197
translate chinese ep7_cd08ed52:

    # a "So... it was the man who took you in?"
    a "所以……是那个收养你的人？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1230
translate chinese ep7_27f9c7e6:

    # mc "If this is all true, then you are going to eat my fists... Jovian."
    mc "如果这一切都是真的，那你就等着尝尝我的拳头吧……乔维安。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1239
translate chinese ep7_879aebed:

    # mc "...If you believe that I deserve to be punished because of what Jovian did to you, then so be it."
    mc "……如果你觉得我理应因为乔维安做的事受到惩罚，那就随你便吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1240
translate chinese ep7_d89e6653:

    # mc "But my Jovian's sins are not my own. What you were doing to us was simply just an act of selfishness and obsession."
    mc "但乔维安的罪孽跟我没有关系。你做的一切都是因为你的自私和偏执。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1249
translate chinese ep7_7c5622f1:

    # h "{i}... *chuckles* Damn..."
    h "{i}…… *笑* 呵……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1254
translate chinese ep7_879aebed_1:

    # mc "...If you believe that I deserve to be punished because of what Jovian did to you, then so be it."
    mc "……如果你觉得我理应因为乔维安做的事受到惩罚，那就随你便吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1255
translate chinese ep7_83b00e73:

    # mc "I understand that Jovian is the one in the wrong here. But that is no reason for you to control our lives."
    mc "我理解，乔维安做了错事。但那不是你玩弄我们的人生的理由。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1278
translate chinese ep7_9fa61d19:

    # mc "Klara might have tried and asked, but she doesn't have any power to do it on her own considering what kind of person she was up against."
    mc "克拉拉确实努力阻止过，但背后的人是你，她估计也没有办法吧。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1281
translate chinese ep7_ec51672e:

    # h "I don't have anything to say about that, just thank Klara. She did that all by herself."
    h "这一点我没什么要说的，去感谢克拉拉就是了。都是她一个人的功劳。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1282
translate chinese ep7_9cc26db9:

    # mc "... Are you telling me the truth?"
    mc "……你说的是实话吗？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1283
translate chinese ep7_b9c7a1ae:

    # h "*chuckles* Figure it out yourself, boy."
    h "*笑* 自己琢磨吧，小子。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1294
translate chinese ep7_7c5622f1_1:

    # h "{i}... *chuckles* Damn..."
    h "{i}…… *笑* 呵……"

# game/ep7.rpy:1475
translate chinese ep7_206e1b61:

    # mc "Well... No?"
    mc "呃……是啊。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1476
translate chinese ep7_0d62e948:

    # m "That's the best decision Klara ever made, I think."
    m "我觉得那是克拉拉做过最好的决定了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1533
translate chinese ep7_22d03fc3:

    # a "It's because of Jovian and how we got dragged into this. It's not your fault."
    a "是因为乔维安，还有我们被莫名其妙地卷进来了。不是你的错。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1700
translate chinese ep7_e025b99a:

    # mc "Klara?"
    mc "克拉拉？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1709
translate chinese ep7_1c48c5c8:

    # mc "You intentionally made them live with me... right? Tell me the truth."
    mc "你故意让她们跟我住在一起的……对吧？跟我说实话。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1720
translate chinese ep7_e2e5edc4:

    # mc "I couldn't have asked for a more perfect gift than that."
    mc "世上没有比这更好的礼物了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1761
translate chinese ep7_d846a2be:

    # j "Sorry about that."
    j "抱歉啊。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1762
translate chinese ep7_044800ef:

    # mc "Hmph. I've gotten used to your games by now. Just cut to the chase—what do I need to know?"
    mc "哼，我已经习惯你整的这出了。赶快说正事——你有什么事要告诉我？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1766
translate chinese ep7_77e10c56:

    # j "She and Sky are descendants of Georgia—her blood runs through them. I swore to protect them the day I stood at Georgia's grave."
    j "她和斯凯是乔治亚的亲人，体内流着一样的血。我在乔治亚的墓前发誓过要保护她们。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1767
translate chinese ep7_bc80ad93:

    # j "But you, you're different."
    j "但是，你不一样。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1768
translate chinese ep7_f25627f2:

    # j "You weren't part of her bloodline, but you came from the same clan—cut from the same legacy, just not directly bound to it."
    j "你和她没有血缘关系，但出身在同一个氏族——虽无直接联系，却有同样的传承。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1769
translate chinese ep7_04f122a8:

    # j "Jovian found you first. And when I learned who you really were... I brought you into one of my networks."
    j "是乔维安先找到你的。而在我知道了你的真实身份之后……就把你带进了我名下的产业里。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1770
translate chinese ep7_b598df49:

    # j "Not to give you a job, but to keep you under the radar until I could be sure the threat was gone."
    j "目的不是为了给你工作，而是在我能确定问题都解决完了之前，让你不被潜在的危险盯上。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1771
translate chinese ep7_f6252979:

    # mc "But... why me? I've always thought I was just some average guy."
    mc "可是……为什么是我？我一直觉得我只是个普通人而已。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1772
translate chinese ep7_e50617bf:

    # j "As far as you know, sure."
    j "那是你觉得。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1773
translate chinese ep7_4f5d7cfa:

    # j "But Klara did one hell of a job keeping you hidden. She made sure you never knew just how close the fire really was."
    j "克拉拉一直以来都把你隐藏得非常好。哪怕是万分危急的时刻，她也没向你透露任何消息。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1776
translate chinese ep7_4590c5e6:

    # mc "You knew all this?"
    mc "你全都知道？"

# game/ep7.rpy:1777
translate chinese ep7_5b37bce8:

    # k "Yes, dear. Every word of it."
    k "是的，亲爱的。全都知道。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1778
translate chinese ep7_57ba024a:

    # k "Georgia and I were daughters of a man who wasn't just a killer, but was one of the most dangerous intelligence operatives our world has ever known."
    k "我和乔治亚的父亲不止是一个杀手，更是这世上最危险的情报官之一。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1779
translate chinese ep7_2e82a79d:

    # k "She followed in his footsteps. I chose another path."
    k "她走了父亲的老路。但我选择了另一条路。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1780
translate chinese ep7_cebf774c:

    # k "I walked away. Gave up everything—status, power, legacy—just for a chance at a normal life."
    k "我逃跑了。放弃了一切——地位，权力，遗产——只为能过上普通的生活。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1781
translate chinese ep7_6cd4e133:

    # k "And keeping you and Sky in the dark was the only way to protect that life."
    k "而要想保护这来之不易的安宁，就只能对你和斯凯守口如瓶。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1782
translate chinese ep7_af4f72b6:

    # k "If I hadn't broken free when I did... I'd be dead. And you—none of this would exist for you now."
    k "如果我那时没有选择成为自由之身……我早就死了。你也一样——你现在有的一切都会不复存在。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1938
translate chinese ep7_501be791:

    # mc "You have to know something about Jovian, Klara."
    mc "你肯定知道有关乔维安的事吧，克拉拉。"

# game/ep7.rpy:1939
translate chinese ep7_a609a301:

    # k "My... Please don't bring up Jovian like that, dear. He's-"
    k "老天……请别这么突然提起乔维安，亲爱的。他已经——"

# game/ep7.rpy:2024
translate chinese ep7_f0ab474f:

    # mc "That's enough for now."
    mc "现在不用再想了。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2981
translate chinese emmarevert_c853708a:

    # mc "I'm going to find Jovian."
    mc "我要去找乔维安。"

# game/ep7.rpy:2992
translate chinese emmarevert_9d6bcede:

    # mc "Me, Klara, Aine, Hera, and you became victims of his actions."
    mc "我，克拉拉，艾妮，赫拉，还有你，都成了他做的事的受害者。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3007
translate chinese emmarevert_76b01650:

    # mc "Half of it was for revenge, and the rest was in hopes of bringing Jovian out of hiding."
    mc "有一半是为了报仇，有一半是为了逼乔维安现身。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3858
translate chinese gwenpause3_17ec8b31:

    # e "From what I understand about Jovian's case, he clearly committed first-degree murder."
    e "根据你的描述，乔维安显然涉嫌一级谋杀。"

# game/ep7.rpy:3927
translate chinese gwenpause3_ebf1783d:

    # mc "I'm sure that's what Klara thinks too."
    mc "克拉拉肯定也是这么想的。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4067
translate chinese gwenpause3_3c4b3d7c:

    # j "Now, I know you want to find Jovian, but take it easy, and don't forget that you are all still young."
    j "我知道你想找乔维安，但慢慢来就好，别忘了你们现在都还很年轻呢。"

# game/ep7.rpy:4383
translate chinese ainethumbsuck_126bb17c:

    # f "Lo and behold!"
    f "猜猜谁来了！"

