translate chinese ep7_8e0fa7f0:

    # mc "But Jovian's sins are not my own. What you were doing to us was simply just an act of selfishness and obsession."
    mc "但乔维安的罪孽跟我没有关系。你做的一切都是因为你的自私和偏执。"

